From 8988cba8a2876a462fd37e3b586d16af5b8048dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A9 project <dmayala@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:20:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] power: supply: Hisense A9 PMI632 power supply, charging
 off by default (sol-pmic proposal 0002)

Telemetry (battery, a9-usb) for Android healthd. Charging only with
pmi632_a9.allow_charging=1 AND hisense,charging-validated in DT; neither
is set by the A9 image.
